{1}{Greetings, traveler.  It seems to me that you're looking for answers.  Perhaps it is time that I answered them for you…}{Greetings, traveler.  It seems to me that you're looking for answers.  Perhaps it is time that I answered them for you…}{}{1}{}{gf2648 1}
{2}{What?  Who are you?}{}{5}{}{5}{gf2701 0}
{3}{Uh…who you?}{}{-4}{}{5}{gf2701 0}
{5}{Don't you know?  Are not you the reincarnation of Nasrudin?  Has it been so long that you don't recognize your old nemesis?  Or perhaps you are not the Living One after all…merely a puppet playing his role…}{Don't you know?  Are not you the reincarnation of Nasrudin?  Has it been so long that you don't recognize your old nemesis?  Or perhaps you are not the Living One after all…merely a puppet playing his role…}{}{2}{}{}
{6}{I don't know what you're talking about…}{}{5}{gf2344 0}{11}{}
{7}{Ah.  You must be Arronax…}{}{5}{gf2344 1}{19}{}
{8}{Uh…I dunno whut you talkin' 'bout…}{}{-4}{gf2344 0}{11}{}
{9}{Uh…you Arrow-nacks?}{}{-4}{gf2344 1}{19}{}
{11}{I see.  Perhaps you are not the Living One.  Perhaps Nasrudin, the coward that he is, will not heed Fate's call and face me in the final battle.  It would be so like him to do so…}{I see.  Perhaps you are not the Living One.  Perhaps Nasrudin, the coward that he is, will not heed Fate's call and face me in the final battle.  It would be so like him to do so…}{}{3}{}{}
{12}{Who are you?}{}{5}{}{15}{}
{13}{Uh…who you?}{}{-4}{}{15}{}
{15}{I am he of the dark, the rightful ruler of this land, the vengeful god of Arcanum and its races.  I am Arronax, and I have come to give you a message…}{I am he of the dark, the rightful ruler of this land, the vengeful god of Arcanum and its races.  I am Arronax, and I have come to give you a message…}{}{4}{}{}
{16}{And that message is?}{}{5}{}{-3}{}
{17}{Whut?}{}{-4}{}{-3}{}
{19}{So…you remember me, do you Nasrudin?  Do you remember what I did to your pathetic Elven Council?  Do you remember when all of Arcanum shook before my power?  Be warned…they will do so again.  I have come to bring you a message…}{So…you remember me, do you Nasrudin?  Do you remember what I did to your pathetic Elven Council?  Do you remember when all of Arcanum shook before my power?  Be warned…they will do so again.  I have come to bring you a message…}{}{5}{}{}
{20}{And that message is?}{}{5}{}{-3}{}
{21}{Whut?}{}{-4}{}{-3}{}
{23}{The message is this.  Whether you are the Living One or not.  Whether or not the coward Nasrudin hides in your bones or still rots in his grave, the inevitable will still come to pass.  I am returning.  It has already been set in motion, and there's nothing you can do about it.  I am returning, and all will fall before me.  Everyone you know...everyone you love...}{The message is this.  Whether you are the Living One or not.  Whether or not the coward Nasrudin hides in your bones or still rots in his grave, the inevitable will still come to pass.  I am returning.  It has already been set in motion, and there's nothing you can do about it.  I am returning, and all will fall before me.  Everyone you know...everyone you love...}{}{6}{}{}
{24}{Wait!  I have nothing to do with this!  Leave us alone!}{}{5}{}{-11}{}
{25}{You bastard!  Face me as a warrior…!}{}{5}{}{-11}{}
{26}{Stop!  I no wanna fight!  No hurt my friends!}{}{-4}{}{-11}{}
{27}{I kill you, Arrow-nacks!  Fight me!}{}{-4}{}{-11}{}
{29}{Do you see my power?  Do you yet understand?  Perhaps I need to be more clear.  No one is safe, traveler.  No one…not even you...}{Do you see my power?  Do you yet understand?  Perhaps I need to be more clear.  No one is safe, traveler.  No one…not even you...}{}{7}{}{}
{30}{Arronax...!}{}{5}{}{-20}{}
{31}{Arrow-nacks…!}{}{-4}{}{-20}{}
{33}{The message is this.  Whether you are the Living One or not.  Whether or not the coward Nasrudin hides in your bones or still rots in his grave, the inevitable will still come to pass.  I am returning.  It has already been set in motion, and there's nothing you can do about it.  I am returning, and all will fall before me.  All...including you...}{The message is this.  Whether you are the Living One or not.  Whether or not the coward Nasrudin hides in your bones or still rots in his grave, the inevitable will still come to pass.  I am returning.  It has already been set in motion, and there's nothing you can do about it.  I am returning, and all will fall before me.  All...including you...}{}{8}{}{}
{34}{Arronax...!}{}{5}{}{-20}{}
{35}{Arrow-nacks…!}{}{-4}{}{-20}{}
{37}{Remember what I have shown you here.  Remember, and tell the world. Arronax is returning to Arcanum…and nothing, nothing will ever be the same.  Farewell…}{Remember what I have shown you here.  Remember, and tell the world. Arronax is returning to Arcanum…and nothing, nothing will ever be the same.  Farewell…}{}{9}{}{}
